<section class='band' id='how-it-works'>
	<div class='container'>
		<div class='band-split-even'>
			<div>
				<h2 class='display-lg'>Set it once.<br>Watch everything.</h2>
				<p class='band-copy' style='margin-top:1.35rem'>
					Open your streams, assign them to games, walk away. ArenaSwap handles every switch from
					that point on. No clicking, no checking, no missing.
				</p>
			</div>
			<ol class='steps'>
				<li>
					<h3>Open your streams.</h3>
					<p>Pull up your games in separate browser tabs. Any streaming service that runs in a browser works with ArenaSwap.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h3>Assign each tab.</h3>
					<p>Open the extension, find each game in the list, and link it to the right tab with a single dropdown.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h3>The best game finds you.</h3>
					<p>ArenaSwap scores every live game and switches to the most exciting one automatically. You just watch.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
